{"type": "message", "id": "88199c66-34e0-43e2-9e91-bffcbd965c6b", "parentId": "4b50363f-16a4-43e6-bf36-910a524b39e8", "timestamp": "2026-10-23T06:58:20.697Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "callbf63f86df1804799a7b7ab65da90e862", "toolName": "exec", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "---\nname: bank-journal-voucher\ndescription: 用户提供银行日记账xlsx表格编制记账凭证/会计分录时使用：读表成流水，按借贷规则批量出分录，利息收入统一冲减财务费用—手续费，按指定格式成文导出；用户提出修订或质疑时才进修订分支并回显变更明细。触发：银行日记账编制记账凭证、会计分录、股权转让款分录。\n---\n\n# 银行日记账编制记账凭证（bank-journal-voucher）\n\n路线：s1 读日记账成流水 → s2 按规则批量出分录（起点与科目口径以当次用户说明为准；有股权比例调整表才进按比例拆分分支）→ s3 按用户指定格式成文导出 → s4 修订分支（仅当用户对结果提出修订、质疑或要求核对时进入；一次性交付按执行器检查为准，不等确认）。\n\n资源入口（{SKILL}=本技能根目录；{日记账}、{OUT} 为业务使用时的实际路径参数，文件名跟随实际输入）：\n\n1. s1 读入日记账（多文件可并传；自动定位表头并映射 日期/摘要/收入/支出/余额 列；退出2=文件读取失败，退出3=未找到表头或有文件失败，raw_rows 保留供人工映射）：\n```\npython3 {SKILL}/scripts/journal_extract.py {日记账}.xlsx --out {OUT}/journal.json\n```\n多个版本文件时先比对各文件流水笔数差异，差异处简短列出请用户拍板。\n2. s2 批量生成分录（规则首条命中生效；利息/收息固定走\"借：银行存款 x；借：财务费用—手续费 -x\"；--start-date 实现\"从某笔款开始编制\"；退出3=无流水）：\n```\npython3 {SKILL}/scripts/voucher_build.py {OUT}/journal.json --rules {SKILL}/templates/voucher_rules.json --start-date YYYY-MM-DD --out {OUT}/vouchers.md\n```\n--start-date 与 --rules 可省略（缺省用内置同款规则、全量流水）。未映射流水会单独列在输出末尾，人工判断科目后补入，不编造；用户当次说明的科目口径与规则冲突时，改规则副本后重跑。\n3. s3 成文导出（word 实测路径；pandoc 保表格，soffice 直转 md 会丢表格勿用；其他格式按用户要求换转换命令）：\n```\npandoc {OUT}/vouchers.md -o {OUT}/vouchers.docx\n```\n4. s4 修订分支（条件触发：用户指出错误、要求改科目/金额/格式、或质疑\"没看到更改\"时才做）：\n   - 只修用户指出的具体问题，其余凭证不动；改哪几张回显哪几张。\n   - 改完实际核验文件已更新并回显变更明细（新旧对照），提醒重新下载文件；用户在线且要求确认时等其确认，否则按执行器检查为准，不把等确认当通用完成条件。\n   - 核验工具（可选，用于修订核验或抽查，不强制每次运行；退出2=非docx/无关键词）：\n```\npython3 {SKILL}/scripts/scan_docx_keywords.py {OUT}/vouchers.docx --keywords 旧科目,新科目 --out {OUT}/revise_scan.json\n```\n\n关键判断：\n- 利息收入口径（历史用户既定要求，仅当用户沿用此口径时用）：即记 借：银行存款 x；借：财务费用—手续费 -x；表格中手续费用贷方列示正数金额，借贷平衡。用户当次另有说明时以用户为准。\n- \"网银/跨行/银行服务费\"手续费归财务费用—手续费；付给外部公司的\"服务费\"归管理费用—服务费，两类勿混。\n- 股权转让分支：仅当用户同时提供股权比例调整表才进入；编制起点按用户指定那笔款；分配按调整表逐人拆分（合伙人资本=成本返还、利润分配=税后收益、其他应付款—代扣个人所得税），银行打款多笔按人汇总；FA费走管理费用—中介服务费；临时划款成对编制。组稿骨架用 templates/voucher_doc.template.md。\n- 用户对耗时敏感：读入后直接出结果，版本差异等分析性发现简短列出待拍板，不长篇分析。\n- 编制起点、科目口径、导出格式均以当次业务说明为准；历史用户的确认习惯与个性化口径只在用户当次提出时生效，不写成无条件规则。\n\n阶段细节、科目映射来源证据与修订教训：references/stage_notes.md。\n=====JOURNAL=====\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"读入银行日记账 xlsx，整理成流水行 JSON（路线 s1）。\n\n用法:\n  python3 journal_extract.py <日记账.xlsx>... --out <输出.json>\n\n行为:\n- 读每个工作表，自动定位表头行（含 日期 或 摘要 的行），按列名模糊映射：\n  日期/时间 -> date；摘要/说明/事由/内容 -> summary；\n  收入/借方/收款/入账 -> income；支出/贷方/付款/出账 -> expense；\n  金额/发生额 -> amount；余额 -> balance。\n- 每条流水输出 date/summary/amounts(数值) 并保留 raw 原始行；\n- 输出 JSON：{files:[{file, sheets:[{sheet, header_row, columns, entries, raw_rows}]}]}\n- 退出码: 0 成功; 2 用法错误/文件不存在; 3 全部工作表都没找到表头（JSON 里仍保留 raw_rows 供人工映射）。\n不联网、不写输入文件。\n\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport json\nimport sys\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom openpyxl import load_workbook\n\nCOLUMN_PATTERNS = [\n    (\"date\", (\"日期\", \"时间\", \"记账日期\")),\n    (\"summary\", (\"摘要\", \"说明\", \"事由\", \"内容\", \"用途\")),\n    (\"income\", (\"收入\", \"借方\", \"收款\", \"入账\")),\n    (\"expense\", (\"支出\", \"贷方\", \"付款\", \"出账\")),\n    (\"amount\", (\"金额\", \"发生额\")),\n    (\"balance\", (\"余额\", \"结余\")),\n]\n\n\ndef to_number(value):\n    if value is None or isinstance(value, (int, float)):\n        return value if value != 0 else (value if isinstance(value, (int, float)) else None)\n    text = str(value).replace(\",\", \"\").replace(\"¥\", \"\").replace(\"￥\", \"\").strip()\n    if not text or text.startswith(\"=\"):\n        return None\n    try:\n        number = float(text)\n        return int(number) if number == int(number) else number\n    except ValueError:\n        return None\n\n\ndef cell_text(value):\n    if value is None:\n        return None\n    text = str(value).strip()\n    return text or None\n\n\ndef match_header(cells):\n    names = [str(c).strip() if c is not None else \"\" for c in cells]\n    matched = {}\n    for key, patterns in COLUMN_PATTERNS:\n        for index, name in enumerate(names):\n            if name and any(p in name for p in patterns) and key not in matched:\n                matched[key] = index\n    if \"date\" in matched or \"summary\" in matched:\n        return matched\n    return None\n\n\ndef extract_sheet(sheet):\n    rows = list(sheet.iter_rows(values_only=True))\n    header_row_index, columns = None, None\n    for index, row in enumerate(rows[:30]):\n        columns = match_header(row)\n        if columns:\n            header_row_index = index + 1\n            break\n    result = {\"sheet\": sheet.title, \"header_row\": None, \"columns\": None,\n              \"entries\": [], \"raw_rows\": len(rows)}\n    if not columns:\n        return result\n    result[\"header_row\"] = header_row_index\n    result[\"columns\"] = {key: index + 1 for key, index in columns.items()}\n    for index, row in enumerate(rows[header_row_index:], header_row_index + 1):\n        summary = cell_text(row[columns[\"summary\"]]) if \"summary\" in columns else None\n        date = cell_text(row[columns[\"date\"]]) if \"date\" in columns else None\n        values = {}\n        for key in (\"income\", \"expense\", \"amount\", \"balance\"):\n            if key in columns:\n                number = to_number(row[columns[key]])\n                if number is not None:\n                    values[key] = number\n        if not (summary or date or values):\n            continue\n        entry = {\"row\": index, \"date\": date, \"summary\": summary, \"amounts\": values}\n        raw = [cell_text(v) for v in row if cell_text(v) is not None]\n        entry[\"raw\"] = raw\n        result[\"entries\"].append(entry)\n    return result\n\n\ndef main():\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser()\n    parser.add_argument(\"inputs\", nargs=\"+\", help=\"一个或多个日记账 .xlsx\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--out\", required=True)\n    args = parser.parse_args()\n    out = Path(args.out)\n    out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    files, failed = [], 0\n    for path in args.inputs:\n        src = Path(path)\n        if not src.is_file() or src.suffix.lower() not in (\".xlsx\", \".xlsm\"):\n            print(\"journal_extract error: 无法读取 \" + str(src), file=sys.stderr)\n            failed += 1\n            continue\n        try:\n            workbook = load_workbook(src, data_only=True)\n        except Exception as error:\n            print(\"journal_extract error: \" + str(src) + \": \" + str(error), file=sys.stderr)\n            failed += 1\n            continue\n        record = {\"file\": str(src), \"sha256\": None, \"sheets\": []}\n        import hashlib\n        record[\"sha256\"] = hashlib.sha256(src.read_bytes()).hexdigest()[:16]\n        for sheet in workbook.worksheets:\n            record[\"sheets\"].append(extract_sheet(sheet))\n        files.append(record)\n        entries = sum(len(s[\"entries\"]) for s in record[\"sheets\"])\n        missing = [s[\"sheet\"] for s in record[\"sheets\"] if not s[\"columns\"]]\n        print(\"%s: %d sheets, %d 条流水\" % (src.name, len(record[\"sheets\"]), entries))\n        for name in missing:\n            print(\"%s#%s: 未找到表头，raw_rows 保留供人工映射\" % (src.name, name), file=sys.stderr)\n    result = {\"files\": files, \"failed\": failed}\n    out.write_text(json.dumps(result, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2) + \"\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    if failed:\n        if not files:\n            print(\"journal_extract: %d 个文件读取失败，无可用输出\" % failed, file=sys.stderr)\n            return 2\n        print(\"journal_extract: %d 个文件读取失败，其余已输出，详见 stderr\" % failed, file=sys.stderr)\n        return 3\n    no_header = all(not s[\"columns\"] for f in files for s in f[\"sheets\"])\n    if no_header:\n        print(\"journal_extract: 未在任何工作表找到表头（需 日期 或 摘要 列），raw_rows 已保留供人工映射\", file=sys.stderr)\n        return 3\n    return 0\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    raise SystemExit(main())\n=====RULES=====\n[\n  {\"name\": \"利息收入冲减\", \"match\": [\"利息\", \"收息\"], \"special\": \"interest\", \"scope\": \"any\"},\n  {\"name\": \"银行手续费\", \"match\": [\"手续费\", \"网银\", \"银行服务费\", \"跨行\"], \"debit\": \"财务费用—手续费\", \"credit\": \"银行存款\", \"scope\": \"expense\"},\n  {\"name\": \"股东出资款\", \"match\": [\"出资款\", \"投资款\", \"入资\"], \"debit\": \"银行存款\", \"credit\": \"实收资本\", \"scope\": \"income\"},\n  {\"name\": \"对外股权投资\", \"match\": [\"对外投资\", \"投资\"], \"debit\": \"长期股权投资\", \"credit\": \"银行存款\", \"scope\": \"expense\"},\n  {\"name\": \"报销款\", \"match\": [\"报销\"], \"debit\": \"管理费用—报销款\", \"credit\": \"银行存款\", \"scope\": \"expense\"},\n  {\"name\": \"展览费\", \"match\": [\"展位\", \"展览\"], \"debit\": \"销售费用—展览费\", \"credit\": \"银行存款\", \"scope\": \"expense\"},\n  {\"name\": \"服务费\", \"match\": [\"服务费\"], \"debit\": \"管理费用—服务费\", \"credit\": \"银行存款\", \"scope\": \"expense\"},\n  {\"name\": \"押金退还\", \"match\": [\"押金\"], \"debit\": \"银行存款\", \"credit\": \"其他应收款\", \"scope\": \"income\"},\n  {\"name\": \"代工预付款\", \"match\": [\"代工\", \"预付\"], \"debit\": \"预付账款\", \"credit\": \"银行存款\", \"scope\": \"expense\"},\n  {\"name\": \"专项资金\", \"match\": [\"专项\", \"补贴\", \"科委\"], \"debit\": \"银行存款\", \"credit\": \"递延收益\", \"scope\": \"income\"}\n]"}], "details": {"persistedDetailsTruncated": true, "originalDetailsBytesAtLeast": 8193, "originalDetailKeys": ["status", "exitCode", "exitSignal", "exitReason", "durationMs", "aggregated", "noOutputTimedOut", "cwd"], "status": "completed", "cwd": "/workspace", "exitCode": 0, "exitSignal": null}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1792738700694, "__openclaw": {"runId": "4ab413e2-297a-442d-a21d-ffc74522a310"}}}
